# VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client examples.
# Substitute IDs and obtain credentials from your local .env; never commit actual tokens.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-your-owner-token-here
@customerId = 1
@entryId = 1
@staffId = 1

### Sign in (use an owner account for ledger operations)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"your-owner-username","password":"your-local-password"}

### Record an invoice
POST {{base}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/ledger-entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"entryType":"DEBIT","amount":100.00,"description":"Invoice 001"}

### Record a payment
POST {{base}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/ledger-entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"entryType":"CREDIT","amount":40.00,"description":"Receipt 001"}

### Correct an invoice without overwriting it (owner/manager)
POST {{base}}/api/customers/ledger-entries/{{entryId}}/corrections
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"replacement":{"entryType":"DEBIT","amount":120.00,"description":"Corrected invoice 001"},"reason":"Missing item found during receipt review"}

### Reverse an entry (owner/manager; only if balance remains nonnegative)
POST {{base}}/api/customers/ledger-entries/{{entryId}}/reversals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Duplicate invoice confirmed"}

### Read history, including originals and correction links
GET {{base}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/ledger-entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read balance
GET {{base}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Archive staff while preserving their transactions (owner)
POST {{base}}/api/owner/staff/{{staffId}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Staff member left the shop"}

### Archive customer while preserving history (owner/manager)
POST {{base}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Closed for new business"}
